// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 9
window.T9_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"adventure – deposit","cards":[{"w":"adventure","p":"n.","d":"an exciting, unusual, or daring experience","c":"冒險；奇遇（可數/不可數）","s":"The brave young explorers packed their backpacks to go on an adventure through the dense tropical jungle.","t":"勇敢的年輕探險家們收拾背包，去茂密的熱帶叢林進行一場冒險。"},{"w":"adventurous","p":"adj.","d":"willing to take risks or try out new experiences","c":"愛冒險的；充滿刺激的","s":"Henry has always had an adventurous spirit, so he loves climbing steep mountains and scuba diving in deep oceans.","t":"亨利一直擁有一種愛冒險的精神，所以他喜歡攀登陡峭的高山並在深海中潛水。"},{"w":"alley","p":"n.","d":"a narrow passageway between or behind buildings","c":"巷道；小巷；小徑（可數）","s":"The police warned pedestrians not to walk alone through the dark alley late at night.","t":"警方警告行人深夜不要獨自走過黑暗的小巷。"},{"w":"right up one's alley","p":"phr.","d":"ideally suited to one's interests or abilities","c":"正合某人的胃口；正是某人的拿手絕活","s":"Since you love baking sweet desserts and designing pastries, this new pastry chef job is right up your alley.","t":"既然你熱愛烘焙甜點與設計糕點，這份新西點師傅工作正合你的胃口。"},{"w":"appeal","p":"v.","d":"to make a serious or urgent request; to be attractive or interesting","c":"呼籲；懇求；吸引（動詞）","s":"The mayor appeared on television to appeal to all citizens for donations after the terrible earthquake hit the city.","t":"在可怕的地震襲擊這座城市後，市長出現在電視上向所有市民呼籲捐款。"},{"w":"appeal","p":"n.","d":"an urgent request for help; the quality of being attractive","c":"呼籲；請求；吸引力；上訴（可數/不可數）","s":"The animal shelter made an urgent public appeal for blankets and dog food before the freezing winter started.","t":"在嚴寒的冬季開始之前，動物收容所向公眾發出了需要毛毯和狗糧的緊急呼籲。"},{"w":"appealing","p":"adj.","d":"attractive or interesting","c":"有吸引力的；動人的","s":"Working from home two days every week sounds like a very appealing option for modern office employees.","t":"每週在家工作兩天對現代辦公室員工來說聽起來是個非常吸引人的選擇。"},{"w":"assist","p":"v.","d":"to help someone, typically by doing a share of the work","c":"協助；幫助（動詞）","s":"The friendly nurse stepped forward quickly to assist the elderly patient with walking down the long corridor.","t":"那位友善的護理師迅速上前，協助年長的病患走過長長的走廊。"},{"w":"assistance","p":"n.","d":"the provision of money, resources, or information to help someone","c":"協助；援助（不可數）","s":"Poor college students from rural villages may apply for government financial assistance to pay their university tuition fees.","t":"來自農村的貧困大學生可以申請政府的財政援助來支付大學學費。"},{"w":"assistant","p":"n.","d":"a person who helps someone in their work","c":"助理；助手（可數）","s":"The busy company director asked his personal assistant to schedule an urgent meeting with overseas investors tomorrow.","t":"繁忙的公司董事請他的個人特助安排明天與海外投資者的緊急會議。"},{"w":"breast","p":"n.","d":"the chest or pectoral region; poultry breast meat","c":"乳房；胸部；雞胸肉（可數）","s":"The detective reached inside his suit coat's breast pocket to take out his official police identification badge.","t":"偵探伸手探入西裝外套的胸前口袋，拿出他的正式警察證件徽章。"},{"w":"make a clean breast of","p":"v.phr.","d":"to confess fully about something one has done wrong","c":"全盤供認；全盤坦白","s":"After hiding the broken vase for two days, Tommy decided to make a clean breast of his mistake to his mother.","t":"在把打破的花瓶藏了兩天之後，湯米決定向母親全盤坦白自己的過錯。"},{"w":"buffalo","p":"n.","d":"a heavily built wild ox with horns","c":"水牛；美洲野牛（可數，單複數同形或 buffaloes）","s":"While driving across the vast national park in Wyoming, tourists admired a massive herd of wild buffalo grazing peacefully.","t":"開車穿過懷俄明州遼闊的國家公園時，遊客們讚嘆一群悠閒吃草的野生美洲野牛。"},{"w":"buffet","p":"n.","d":"a meal consisting of several dishes from which guests serve themselves","c":"自助餐；歐式自助餐（可數，/bəˈfeɪ/ 或 /ˈbʊfeɪ/）","s":"The luxury resort hotel offers a lavish morning breakfast buffet with fresh bakery items, eggs, and tropical fruits.","t":"這家豪華度假飯店提供豐盛的早晨自助餐，供應新鮮烘焙點心、雞蛋和熱帶水果。"},{"w":"bullet","p":"n.","d":"a metal projectile for firing from a rifle or handgun","c":"子彈；項目符號（可數）","s":"Traveling between Tokyo and Osaka on the Japanese bullet train takes only about two and a half hours.","t":"搭乘日本子彈列車在東京和大阪之間往返只需要大約兩個半小時。"},{"w":"bite the bullet","p":"v.phr.","d":"to face a difficult situation with courage and fortitude","c":"咬緊牙關勇敢面對；硬著頭皮做","s":"Although going to the dentist causes him great fear, Gary must bite the bullet and have his rotten tooth pulled out.","t":"雖然看牙醫讓他感到非常害怕，蓋瑞必須咬緊牙關硬著頭皮去，把爛掉的牙齒拔掉。"},{"w":"cocktail","p":"n.","d":"an alcoholic drink consisting of a spirit mixed with other ingredients","c":"雞尾酒；調酒；混合物（可數）","s":"The bride and groom invited all their wedding guests to enjoy a sunset cocktail party beside the blue swimming pool.","t":"新郎新娘邀請所有婚禮賓客在藍色泳池旁享受日落雞尾酒派對。"},{"w":"comma","p":"n.","d":"a punctuation mark (,) indicating a pause between parts of a sentence","c":"逗號（可數）","s":"The English teacher gently reminded students to insert a comma before the coordinating conjunction when joining two complete sentences.","t":"英文老師親切地提醒學生，在連接兩個完整句子時，要在對等連接詞前面加上一個逗號。"},{"w":"deposit","p":"v.","d":"to put or keep money in a bank account; to place something down carefully","c":"存（錢）；放置；沈澱（動詞）","s":"Every month right after receiving his salary, Kevin visits the neighborhood ATM to deposit some savings in his bank account.","t":"每個月領到薪水後，凱文都會造訪社區ATM將部分積蓄存入他的銀行帳戶。"},{"w":"deposit","p":"n.","d":"a sum of money placed in a bank; a sum paid as a guarantee or pledge","c":"存款；保證金；押金；沉積物（可數）","s":"Before moving into the newly renovated apartment downtown, the tenant was required to pay two months' rent as a security deposit.","t":"在搬進市中心這間新裝潢的公寓之前，房客被要求支付兩個月的租金作為安全押金。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"dive – entertainer","cards":[{"w":"dive","p":"v.","d":"to plunge head first into water; to steep drop rapidly","c":"跳水；潛水；暴跌（動詞）","s":"The graceful young athlete leaped off the high board to dive into the cool swimming pool.","t":"那位優雅的年輕運動員從高跳板躍下，跳入清涼的泳池中。"},{"w":"dive","p":"n.","d":"a plunge into water; a steep descent; a cheap, disreputable nightclub or bar","c":"跳水；俯衝；廉價小酒吧（可數）","s":"The Olympic swimmer executed a nearly perfect dive that earned loud cheers from the spectators.","t":"那位奧運游泳選手完成了一次近乎完美的跳水，贏得了觀眾的熱烈歡呼。"},{"w":"diver","p":"n.","d":"a person who dives underwater, especially with scuba gear","c":"潛水員；跳水運動員（可數）","s":"Equipped with oxygen tanks and heavy wet suits, the brave diver explored the mysterious sunken shipwreck.","t":"配戴氧氣筒和厚重防寒衣的勇敢潛水員探索了神祕的沉船殘骸。"},{"w":"domestic","p":"adj.","d":"relating to the running of a home or family relations; existing within a country","c":"家庭的；國內的；馴養的","s":"Passengers flying on a domestic flight do not need to show an international passport at airport security.","t":"搭乘國內航班的乘客在機場安檢處不需要出示國際護照。"},{"w":"domesticate","p":"v.","d":"to tame an animal and keep it as a pet or on a farm","c":"馴養；馴化；栽培（動詞）","s":"Thousands of years ago, ancient human hunters learned how to domesticate wild wolves into loyal guard dogs.","t":"數千年前，古代人類獵人學會了如何將野狼馴養成忠誠的看門狗。"},{"w":"dull","p":"adj.","d":"lacking interest or excitement; lacking brightness; not sharp","c":"枯燥乏味的；陰沉的；遲鈍的；鈍的","s":"The long historical movie was so dull that several bored audience members fell asleep in the cinema.","t":"這部冗長的歷史電影是如此枯燥乏味，以至於電影院裡好幾個無聊的觀眾都睡著了。"},{"w":"dull","p":"v.","d":"to make or become less sharp, bright, or intense","c":"使變鈍；使遲鈍；緩和（動詞）","s":"Constant loud industrial factory noise can gradually dull workers' hearing if they do not wear protective earplugs.","t":"如果工人不戴防護耳塞，持續刺耳的工廠噪音會逐漸使…遲鈍／損害工人的聽力。"},{"w":"all work and no play makes Jack a dull boy","p":"idiom","d":"without time off from work, a person becomes bored and uninteresting","c":"只工作不玩樂，聰明孩子也變傻（勞逸結合）","s":"My father warned me not to spend every weekend studying without exercising because all work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.","t":"我父親警告我不要每個週末都不運動光讀書，因為只工作不玩樂，聰明孩子也變傻。"},{"w":"electronic","p":"adj.","d":"having or operating with components such as microchips and transistors","c":"電子的；使用電子設備的","s":"Passengers are politely reminded to power down all portable electronic devices before the airplane begins taking off.","t":"在飛機開始起飛前，有禮貌地提醒乘客關閉所有便攜式電子設備。"},{"w":"electronics","p":"n.","d":"the branch of physics and technology concerned with the design of circuits; devices","c":"電子學；電子產品／電子設備（恆用複數）","s":"The university student decided to major in computer science and electronics to design next-generation robotic systems.","t":"那名大學生決定主修電腦科學與電子學，以設計下一代機器人系統。"},{"w":"electricity","p":"n.","d":"a form of energy resulting from the existence of charged particles","c":"電力；電（不可數）","s":"Giant coastal wind turbines and rooftop solar panels produce clean green electricity without emitting harmful greenhouse gases.","t":"巨大的沿海風力發電機和屋頂太陽能板可以產生乾淨的綠色電力，而不會排放有害的溫室氣體。"},{"w":"electric","p":"adj.","d":"operating by or producing electricity; thrillingly exciting","c":"用電的；電動的；令人極度興奮的","s":"Many environmentally conscious city drivers are switching to zero-emission electric cars to reduce air pollution and fuel costs.","t":"許多具備環保意識的城市駕駛人正轉向使用零排放的電動汽車，以減少空氣污染和燃料成本。"},{"w":"electrical","p":"adj.","d":"concerned with, operating by, or producing electricity","c":"電氣的；與電相關的；電學的","s":"After graduating from high school with top grades in mathematics, Mark chose to study electrical engineering at national university.","t":"以優異的數學成績高中畢業後，馬克選擇在國立大學攻讀電機工程。"},{"w":"electrician","p":"n.","d":"a person who installs and repairs electrical equipment","c":"電工；水電電氣技師（可數）","s":"When the ceiling lights in our apartment suddenly flickered and went dark, my father called a certified electrician to check the circuit breaker.","t":"當我們公寓的天花板燈突然閃爍並變暗時，我父親打電話給一位合格的電工來檢查斷路器。"},{"w":"entertainment","p":"n.","d":"the action of providing amusement or enjoyment","c":"娛樂；表演娛樂活動（不可數/可數）","s":"Streaming movies and listening to music online have become the most popular forms of daily entertainment for teenagers.","t":"在線上觀看串流電影和聽音樂已成為青少年日常最受歡迎的娛樂形式。"},{"w":"entertain","p":"v.","d":"to provide someone with amusement or enjoyment; to host guests","c":"娛樂；款待；招待（動詞）","s":"The cheerful magician performed clever card tricks and made balloon animals to entertain the excited children at the birthday party.","t":"那位開朗的魔術師表演聰明的紙牌魔術並製作氣球動物，在生日派對上娛樂逗樂興奮的孩子們。"},{"w":"entertaining","p":"adj.","d":"providing amusement or enjoyment","c":"有趣的；令人愉快的；具娛樂性的","s":"The humorous English teacher shared many entertaining stories from his college travels that kept the whole class laughing.","t":"那位幽默的英文老師分享了他大學旅行時的許多有趣的故事，讓全班哈哈大笑。"},{"w":"entertainer","p":"n.","d":"a person, such as a singer, dancer, or comedian, whose job is to entertain others","c":"藝人；表演者（可數）","s":"Crowds of curious tourists gathered around the talented street entertainer who was juggling burning torches in the city square.","t":"成群好奇的遊客聚集在那位在城市廣場上雜耍火把的才華洋溢的街頭藝人周圍。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"envy – handkerchief","cards":[{"w":"envy","p":"v.","d":"to feel a desire to have a quality, possession, or other desirable attribute belonging to someone else","c":"羨慕；嫉妒（動詞）","s":"I really envy my sister for her natural talent to speak five foreign languages fluently.","t":"我真的很羨慕我姐姐擁有能流利說五種外語的天賦。"},{"w":"envy","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of discontented or resentful longing aroused by someone else's possessions","c":"羨慕；嫉妒（不可數/可數）","s":"When Jason drove his shiny new sports car to school, his classmates were practically green with envy.","t":"當傑森開著他閃亮的新跑車到學校時，他的同學們簡直嫉妒得臉都綠了。"},{"w":"envious","p":"adj.","d":"feeling or showing envy","c":"羨慕的；嫉妒的","s":"Kelly was genuinely envious of her best friend who had won a full scholarship to Harvard University.","t":"凱莉由衷地羨慕她最好的朋友，因為她獲得了哈佛大學的全額獎學金。"},{"w":"jealous","p":"adj.","d":"feeling or showing envy of someone or their achievements and advantages; fiercely protective","c":"嫉妒的；吃醋的；用心守護的","s":"The little boy became quite jealous of his baby sister whenever his mother held her in her arms.","t":"每當母親把剛出生的小妹妹抱在懷裡時，那個小男孩就變得相當吃醋／嫉妒。"},{"w":"jealousy","p":"n.","d":"the state or feeling of being jealous","c":"嫉妒；吃醋；戒備（不可數/可數）","s":"In Shakespeare's famous tragedy Othello, the noble hero was tragically destroyed by blind jealousy and mistrust.","t":"在莎士比亞著名的悲劇《奧賽羅》中，高貴的英雄悲劇性地被盲目的嫉妒和不信任所毀滅。"},{"w":"fist","p":"n.","d":"a person's hand when the fingers are bent in towards the palm and held tightly","c":"拳頭；拳（可數）","s":"The angry customer clenched his fist tightly as he demanded a full refund from the store manager.","t":"憤怒的顧客在要求店經理全額退款時緊緊握住了拳頭。"},{"w":"hand over fist","p":"adv.phr.","d":"very rapidly, especially when making or losing money","c":"迅速大量地（賺錢或賠錢）","s":"After the innovative mobile app went viral globally, the startup company began making money hand over fist.","t":"在這款創新的行動應用程式在全球爆紅後，這家新創公司開始迅速大量地賺錢／財源滾滾。"},{"w":"flavour","p":"n.","d":"the distinctive taste of a food or drink (UK spelling; US: flavor)","c":"風味；味道；特色（可數/不可數）","s":"The chef added a pinch of fresh herbs and crushed black pepper to enhance the natural flavour of the soup.","t":"主廚加入少許新鮮香草和碎黑胡椒，以增添湯品的天然風味。"},{"w":"flavor","p":"v.","d":"to give substance, distinctive taste, or character to food or drink","c":"給…調味；為…增添風味（動詞）","s":"My grandmother likes to flavor her famous winter beef stew with cinnamon, star anise, and sweet carrots.","t":"我祖母喜歡用肉桂、八角和甜胡蘿蔔為她著名的冬季燉牛肉調味。"},{"w":"flavor of the month","p":"idiom","d":"someone or something that is temporarily very popular or fashionable","c":"當紅一時的人事物；曇花一現的風尚","s":"Pop boy bands come and go very quickly in the music business, often being the flavor of the month for just a year.","t":"流行男子樂團在音樂界來去匆匆，往往只是紅極一時的當紅炸子雞／曇花一現的人物短短一年。"},{"w":"fountain","p":"n.","d":"an ornamental structure in a pool from which one or more jets of water are pumped","c":"噴水池；噴泉；源泉（可數）","s":"After finishing thirty minutes of intense jogging in the sun, Kevin stopped by the park drinking fountain for cold water.","t":"在陽光下完成了三十分鐘的劇烈慢跑後，凱文在公園的飲水機旁停下來喝涼水。"},{"w":"glare","p":"v.","d":"to stare in an angry or fierce way; to shine with a strong, dazzling light","c":"怒目而視；發出強烈刺眼的光（動詞）","s":"The strict librarian looked over her glasses to glare angrily at the noisy students talking on their cellphones.","t":"嚴格的圖書館管理員透過眼鏡怒目而視那些在手機上講話的吵鬧學生。"},{"w":"glare","p":"n.","d":"a fierce or angry stare; a strong and dazzling light","c":"怒視；刺眼的強光（可數/不可數）","s":"When Tommy accidentally stepped on his sister's clean white shoes, she gave him a fierce glare of pure annoyance.","t":"當湯米不小心踩到他姐姐乾淨的白鞋時，她給了他一個完全惱怒的狠狠怒視。"},{"w":"gown","p":"n.","d":"a long, elegant dress worn on formal occasions; a protective outer garment","c":"禮服；長袍；手術袍（可數）","s":"The Hollywood actress looked breathtaking on the red carpet wearing an elegant silk evening gown decorated with crystals.","t":"那位好萊塢女演員在紅地毯上穿著綴有水晶的優雅絲質晚禮服，顯得美艷動人。"},{"w":"handkerchief","p":"n.","d":"a square of cotton or other fabric carried in the pocket for wiping one's nose or eyes","c":"手帕；手絹（可數，複數 handkerchiefs 或 handkerchieves）","s":"During the sad ending of the touching romantic movie, Susan pulled a soft handkerchief from her purse to wipe her tears.","t":"在那部感人浪漫電影的悲傷結局中，蘇珊從皮包裡拿出一條柔軟的手帕擦拭眼淚。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"hike – participant","cards":[{"w":"hike","p":"v.","d":"to go for a long walk, especially across country or along trails; to increase sharply","c":"徒步健行；大幅提高（價格等）（動詞）","s":"Every autumn, our outdoor adventure club loves to hike along scenic mountain trails to admire the colorful red maple leaves.","t":"每年秋天，我們的戶外探險俱樂部都喜歡沿著風景秀麗的山間小徑徒步健行，欣賞五彩繽紛的紅楓葉。"},{"w":"hike","p":"n.","d":"a long walk or walking tour; a sharp increase in price or tax","c":"健行；徒步旅行；大幅上漲（可數）","s":"Local commuters expressed anger over the recent subway fare hike, arguing that public transportation should remain affordable.","t":"當地通勤者對最近的地鐵票價大幅上漲表示憤怒，認為大眾運輸應該保持平價實惠。"},{"w":"hiker","p":"n.","d":"a person who goes on long walks in the countryside or mountains","c":"健行者；遠足登山客（可數）","s":"The park ranger reminded every enthusiastic hiker to stay on designated marked trails to prevent damaging fragile wilderness plants.","t":"國家公園巡邏員提醒每一位熱情的健行登山客留在指定的標記路徑上，以防止破壞脆弱的荒野植物。"},{"w":"take a hike","p":"idiom","d":"a rude expression used to tell someone to go away and stop bothering you","c":"滾開；走開；別來煩我（俚語）","s":"When the rude stranger kept making inappropriate remarks at the bus stop, Kelly angrily told him to take a hike.","t":"當那個粗魯的陌生人在公車站不斷說出不恰當的話時，凱莉憤怒地叫他滾開／走開別來煩。"},{"w":"historic","p":"adj.","d":"famous or important in history, or likely to be remembered as significant","c":"歷史上著名的；具有重大歷史意義的","s":"The signing of the international peace treaty was truly a historic moment that ended decades of devastating civil war.","t":"國際和平條約的簽署確實是一個具有重大歷史意義的時刻，結束了數十年破壞性的內戰。"},{"w":"historical","p":"adj.","d":"belonging to the past, of or concerning the study of history","c":"歷史的；史學的；基於歷史事實的","s":"Professor Adams dedicated twenty years of rigorous historical research to examining trade routes during the Roman Empire.","t":"亞當斯教授投入了二十年嚴謹的歷史研究，深入考察羅馬帝國時期的貿易路線。"},{"w":"historian","p":"n.","d":"an expert in or student of history, especially that of a particular period","c":"歷史學家；史學專家（可數）","s":"A prominent European historian gave an insightful public lecture about the underlying economic causes of the French Revolution.","t":"一位著名的歐洲歷史學家就法國大革命的潛在經濟起因發表了一場深刻的公開演講。"},{"w":"maid","p":"n.","d":"a female domestic servant; a hotel room attendant","c":"女僕；侍女；飯店客房清潔人員（可數）","s":"Every afternoon while guests are out sightseeing, the efficient hotel maid changes bedsheets and replenishes fresh towels.","t":"每天下午當房客外出觀光時，手腳俐落的飯店女房務員都會更換床單並補充乾淨的毛巾。"},{"w":"old maid","p":"n.phr.","d":"an unmarried woman regarded as beyond the age of marriage (old-fashioned/derogatory); a card game","c":"老姑娘；抽鬼牌遊戲","s":"During the rainy afternoon at the cabin, the excited grandchildren sat in a cozy circle to play old maid.","t":"在木屋度過下雨午後時，興奮的孫子孫女們圍成一個溫馨的小圈子玩抽鬼牌遊戲。"},{"w":"mineral","p":"n.","d":"a solid, naturally occurring inorganic substance; essential dietary element","c":"礦物；礦物質（可數/不可數）","s":"Drinking a refreshing bottle of chilled mineral water helps replenish vital electrolytes after running ten kilometers.","t":"跑完十公里後，喝一瓶冰鎮清爽的礦泉水有助於補充重要的電解質。"},{"w":"mineral","p":"adj.","d":"of, concerning, or containing minerals","c":"礦物的；含礦物的","s":"The developing country achieved rapid economic growth after discovering vast underground mineral deposits of iron ore.","t":"在發現地下蘊藏龐大的鐵礦礦藏後，這個開發中國家實現了快速的經濟增長。"},{"w":"participate","p":"v.","d":"to take part in an action or event","c":"參加；參與（動詞）","s":"High school teachers warmly encourage all students to actively participate in after-school sports clubs and volunteer work.","t":"高中老師熱情鼓勵所有學生積極參與課後體育社團和志工服務。"},{"w":"participation","p":"n.","d":"the action of taking part in something","c":"參加；參與（不可數）","s":"The university professor grades students based on their final research papers and active classroom participation in discussions.","t":"大學教授根據學生的期末研究報告以及在課堂討論中的積極參與來評定成績。"},{"w":"participant","p":"n.","d":"a person who takes part in something","c":"參與者；參加者（可數）","s":"Each registered participant at the international academic conference received a badge, a program booklet, and a tote bag.","t":"國際學術會議的每一位註冊參加者都收到了一枚名牌胸章、一本議程手冊和一個帆布提袋。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"peep – presenter","cards":[{"w":"peep","p":"v.","d":"to look quickly and furtively at something, especially through a narrow opening; to make a high squeak","c":"偷看；窺視；微微露出；唧唧叫（動詞）","s":"The curious little boy knelt down quietly on the carpet to peep through the keyhole of the locked playroom.","t":"好奇的小男孩悄悄跪在地毯上，透過上鎖遊戲室的鑰匙孔偷看。"},{"w":"peep","p":"n.","d":"a quick or furtive look; a brief high-pitched sound or squeak","c":"偷看；窺視；微弱聲音；嗶嗶聲（可數）","s":"Before our mother officially opened the birthday gift boxes, my excited sister took a quick peep inside.","t":"在我們母親正式打開生日禮物盒之前，我興奮的妹妹悄悄往裡面偷看了一看。"},{"w":"peeping Tom","p":"n.phr.","d":"a person who derives pleasure from secretly watching other people undressing or engaging in private activities","c":"偷窺狂；偷窺者（源自英國高蒂娃夫人傳說）","s":"The suspicious man was arrested by the local police after residents reported a peeping Tom lurking outside ground-floor windows.","t":"在居民通報有一名偷窺狂潛伏在一樓窗戶外之後，那名可疑男子被當地警察逮捕了。"},{"w":"pipe","p":"n.","d":"a tube of metal, plastic, or other material used to convey water, gas, or other substances; a device for smoking tobacco","c":"管子；導管；水管；煙斗；管樂器（可數）","s":"During the freezing winter frost, the underground water pipe suddenly burst and flooded the neighborhood street.","t":"在酷寒的嚴冬霜凍期間，地下水管突然爆裂並淹沒了社區街道。"},{"w":"pipe","p":"v.","d":"to convey liquid or gas through a pipe; to speak in a high voice","c":"用管道輸送；用尖細聲音說話（動詞）","s":"Engineers designed a modern pipeline network to pipe fresh drinking water from the reservoir to mountain villages.","t":"工程師設計了一個現代化的管道網絡，將新鮮飲用水從水庫用管線輸送到山區村莊。"},{"w":"pipe dream","p":"n.phr.","d":"an unattainable or fanciful hope or scheme","c":"白日夢；不可實現的幻想","s":"Building a luxury space hotel on the moon within five years was dismissed by top scientists as a mere pipe dream.","t":"頂尖科學家認為，五年內在月球上建造豪華太空飯店純屬不可實現的白日夢。"},{"w":"piping hot","p":"adj.phr.","d":"very hot (especially of food or drink)","c":"滾燙的；熱騰騰的（形容食物或湯）","s":"On chilly winter evenings, there is nothing more comforting than enjoying a bowl of piping hot chicken noodle soup.","t":"在寒冷的冬日夜晚，沒有什麼比享用一碗熱騰騰滾燙的雞肉麵條湯更令人身心舒暢的了。"},{"w":"potato","p":"n.","d":"a starchy plant tuber that is one of the most important food crops worldwide","c":"馬鈴薯；洋芋（可數，複數 potatoes）","s":"The controversial new tax reform bill quickly became a political hot potato that neither party wanted to handle.","t":"那項極具爭議的新稅制改革法案迅速成為了一個政治上的燙手山芋，雙方政黨都不願意碰。"},{"w":"couch potato","p":"n.phr.","d":"a person who takes little or no exercise and watches a lot of television","c":"電視迷；整天窩在沙發看電視的人；懶骨頭","s":"Instead of staying indoors as a lazy couch potato all weekend, you should go outside to ride your bicycle in the sunshine.","t":"與其整個週末當個待在室內的懶散沙發馬鈴薯／電視迷懶骨頭，你應該到戶外的陽光下騎自行車。"},{"w":"hot potato","p":"n.phr.","d":"a controversial issue or awkward situation that is difficult to handle","c":"燙手山芋；難以處理的棘手問題","s":"The sudden corruption scandal among city council members became a dangerous political hot potato for the mayor during reelection.","t":"市議員突然爆發的貪腐醜聞成為了市長連任期間極其危險的政治燙手山芋。"},{"w":"small potatoes","p":"n.phr.","d":"something insignificant, trivial, or of little importance","c":"微不足道的事物；小人物；微小數額","s":"Losing ten dollars on a lottery ticket was just small potatoes compared to his massive business profits that quarter.","t":"在彩券上損失十美元與他那季龐大的商業利潤相比，只是微不足道的小事。"},{"w":"presentation","p":"n.","d":"a speech or talk in which a new idea or product is shown and explained; awarding ceremony","c":"簡報；演講；呈現；頒獎典禮（可數/不可數）","s":"The university student spent three sleepless nights preparing colorful slides to give a persuasive presentation about renewable solar energy.","t":"那名大學生熬了三個通宵製作精美的投影片，就可再生太陽能進行了一場極具說服力的簡報／報告。"},{"w":"present","p":"v.","d":"to introduce or show formally; to offer or give a gift or award","c":"呈現；發表；贈送；引見（動詞，/prɪˈzent/）","s":"The brilliant young scientist was invited on stage to present her innovative medical research findings to international doctors.","t":"那位才華洋溢的年輕科學家受邀上台，向國際醫師們發表／呈現她創新的醫學研究成果。"},{"w":"presenter","p":"n.","d":"a person who introduces a television or radio show, or who gives a formal presentation","c":"主持人；報告者；簡報者（可數）","s":"The popular television news presenter reported live from the flood area with admirable calm and clear articulation.","t":"那位受歡迎的電視新聞主播／主持人以令人讚賞的冷靜和清晰的咬字在洪災現場進行了現場直播。"}]}];
